  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Federal Celesta Credit Card is a lifetime free card primarily focused on rewards and travel. Cardholders can earn 3X reward points on travel and international spends. In addition, the card offers other travel benefits, including a low forex markup fee of 2% and complimentary domestic & international lounge visits, enhancing its overall value for frequent travellers. Besides travel, the card offers 2X rewards on dining expenses and a base reward rate on other spends. With no joining fee, it also offers an Amazon Pay e-gift voucher worth Rs. 600 as a welcome benefit, which adds to the card’s value. Overall, Federal Bank Celesta Credit Card turns out to be an all-rounder credit card with benefits across multiple categories such as travel, dining, shopping, entertainment, and more. It is a suitable option for consumers looking for a basic rewards credit card with all-round benefits.",
